    "Total Coliform (Revised Total Coliform Rule, page 8): Compliance Achieved 'No'; 6 total-coliform-positive samples and 0 E. coli-positive samples in 2025 against a treatment technique of no more than 1 positive monthly sample.",
    "Page 8: 'During the past year we were required to conduct one Level 1 assessment. One Level 1 assessment was completed. In addition, we were required to take two corrective actions of which one has been completed while we are in progress to complete the second corrective action. Additionally, during the past year one Level 2 assessment was required to be completed for our water system. One Level 2 assessment was completed. We were required to take four corrective actions, and we completed all these actions.'"
